{"t":"COF","n":"Capital One Financial Corporation","nKo":"캐피탈원금융","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":180.01,"chg":1.35,"chgPct":0.00756,"prev":178.66,"dayH":181.95,"dayL":177.85,"w52H":259.64,"w52L":174.24,"vol":5356300,"avgVol":5176810,"mcap":108281987072,"pe":11.03,"fpe":7.54,"eps":16.32,"feps":23.87,"pb":1.03,"div":3.2,"divY":0.0178,"beta":1.09,"short":7248652,"shortPct":0.0136,"shortRatio":1.83,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Financial Services","sKo":"금융 서비스","i":"Credit Services","iKo":"신용 서비스","city":"McLean","emp":77500,"web":"https://www.capitalone.com","sum":"Capital One Financial Corporation operates as the financial services holding company for the Capital One, National Association, which engages in the provision of various financial products and services in the United States, Canada, and the United Kingdom. It operates through three segments: Credit Card, Consumer Banking, and Commercial Banking. The company accepts checking accounts, money market deposits, negotiable order of withdrawals, savings deposits, time deposits, and sweep accounts. Its loan products include credit card and personal loans; auto and retail banking loans; and commercial and multifamily real estate, and commercial and industrial loans. The company offers credit and debit card products; bank lending; and provides advisory, capital markets, net interchange, treasury mana","sumKo":"Capital One Financial Corporation은 미국, 캐나다 및 영국에서 다양한 금융 상품 및 서비스를 제공하는 Capital One, National Association의 금융 서비스 지주 회사로 운영됩니다. 신용카드, 소비자금융, 상업금융의 3개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 회사는 당좌 예금, 머니 마켓 예금, 협상 가능한 인출 순서, 저축 예금, 정기 예금 및 스윕 계좌를 허용합니다. 대출상품에는 신용카드, 개인대출 등이 있습니다. 자동차 및 소매 금융 대출; 상업용 및 다세대 부동산, 상업용 및 산업용 대출. 회사는 신용카드 및 직불카드 상품을 제공합니다. 은행 대출; 자문, 자본 시장, 순 교환, 재무 마나를 제공합니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":34250000000,"ni":7044000000},{"y":2023,"rev":36787000000,"ni":4582000000},{"y":2024,"rev":39112000000,"ni":4445000000},{"y":2025,"rev":53434000000,"ni":2181000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":155830000